      }
    },
    "collapsible_menu_j3r7Qm": {
      "type": "collapsible_menu",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_tab_mXapQV": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What makes Kairali different from other Ayurvedic brands?",
            "content": "<p>While many brands claim to be \"Ayurvedic,\" Kairali stands apart with 80+ years of authentic heritage. We don't just follow trends—we've been living and breathing Ayurveda since 1939. Every product is crafted with classical formulations passed down through generations, not modern shortcuts or diluted versions.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_tWBkdb": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How is your quality better than competitors?",
            "content": "<p>Most brands outsource manufacturing or compromise on ingredient quality. We control everything in-house: from sourcing premium herbs to formulation, production, and quality testing. Our AYUSH certification isn't just a badge—it's a commitment to purity that we've maintained for eight decades. We never use fillers, synthetic fragrances, or chemical preservatives that many \"natural\" brands sneak into their products.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_NPTULK": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are your prices competitive despite premium quality?",
            "content": "<p>Because we manufacture everything ourselves. Unlike competitors who rely on third-party manufacturers and middlemen, our direct-to-consumer model eliminates unnecessary markups. You're paying for authentic Ayurveda, not fancy marketing or inflated retail margins.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_mxqrbm": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do other brands offer the same level of expertise?",
            "content": "<p>Few can match our legacy. Kairali isn't just a product line—we own and operate award-winning Ayurvedic resorts and treatment centers where our formulations have been tested on thousands of patients over decades. Our products aren't lab experiments; they're proven remedies refined through real-world healing experiences.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "icon": "none"
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_yKKpgT": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What about customer support and consultation?",
            "content": "<p>Many brands sell you a product and disappear. We offer FREE personalized consultations with certified Ayurvedic doctors who help you choose the right products for your unique dosha and health needs. Our customer support during our published support hours ensures you're never alone on your wellness journey.</p>",
